Output docs/vhs/out/11-mouse-drag-in-tree.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Hide
Type "export SENDITO_KEYCHAIN=memory && cd /tmp/sendito-demo && clear" Enter
Show
Type "sendito" Enter
Sleep 2s
# VHS cannot drive the mouse; this tape shows the keyboard equivalent (m: move).
Type "/health" Enter Type "m" Sleep 800ms Type "Orders" Enter Sleep 1500ms
Ctrl+Q
